Scope

This license covers the code: build.mjs, tools/, looks/*.mjs, assets/kit.*,
art/art.js, scenes-src/, compositions/ and site/index.html.

It does not cover the creative work, which is (c) 2026 Abhinav, all rights
reserved: the song "Lossless" and its lyrics, the character designs and
reference images, the traced artwork in art/*.js (other than art/art.js), and
the rendered films and the stills in docs/. Watching, linking and embedding are welcome; ask before
reusing them.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party notices

The design languages, palettes and the Plainclothes art style are from
katagami.ai and remain theirs. Only their tokens (colours, font names, radii)
are used here.

Fonts fetched into assets/fonts/ by `npm run fonts` are from Google Fonts and
keep their own licenses (mostly SIL Open Font License 1.1).

HyperFrames and GSAP are used under their own licenses and are not vendored in
this repository except as copied into site/film/vendor/ at build time.
